        335
      ],
      "annotations": [
        "02 / PD and Motor Backup Supplies",
        "PD VBUS or DATA USB starts logic; the motor-bus buck retains brake-control backup after PD loss.",
        "U5: PD 5-48 V buck. U22: VMOTOR backup buck. U23/U24 + R111: status-interlocked OR into board V3V3; U26/U27 power the separate MCU rail."
